        "description": "Several security issues were discovered in the Linux kernel. An attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system. This update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:   - Cryptographic API;   - Media drivers;   - Netfilter;   - TLS protocol; (CVE-2025-39946, CVE-2025-39964, CVE-2025-39993, CVE-2025-40018)",
